n",[1029,1031,1033,1035],{"plaintext":1030},"/documentation/microshift/4.12",{"plaintext":1032},"/documentation/microshift/4.12/*",{"plaintext":1034},"/documentation/red_hat_build_of_microshift/4.12",{"plaintext":1036},"/documentation/red_hat_build_of_microshift/4.12/*",{"uid":540,"title":1038,"bannerVariant":664,"bannerType":922,"bannerText":1039,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1041,"latestVersionLink":15,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"MicroShift is Technology Preview software only.",{"markdown":1040},"For more information about the support scope of Red Hat Technology Preview software, see [Technology Preview Support Scope](https://access.redhat.com/support/offerings/techpreview/).\n",[1042,1044],{"plaintext":1043},"/documentation/red_hat_build_of_microshift/4.13",{"plaintext":1045},"/documentation/red_hat_build_of_microshift/4.13/*",{"uid":1047,"title":1048,"bannerVariant":664,"bannerType":1049,"bannerText":1050,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1051,"latestVersionLink":15,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"1","OpenShift Container Storage is now OpenShift Data Foundation starting with version 4.9","rebrand banner",{"markdown":15},[1052,1054,1056,1058,1060,1062,1064,1066,1068,1070,1072,1074],{"plaintext":1053},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_container_storage",{"plaintext":1055},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_container_storage/",{"plaintext":1057},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_container_storage/*",{"plaintext":1059},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_data_foundation/4.9",{"plaintext":1061},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_data_foundation/4.9/",{"plaintext":1063},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_data_foundation/4.9/*",{"plaintext":1065},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_data_foundation/4.10",{"plaintext":1067},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_data_foundation/4.10/",{"plaintext":1069},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_data_foundation/4.10/*",{"plaintext":1071},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_data_foundation/4.11",{"plaintext":1073},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_data_foundation/4.11/",{"plaintext":1075},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_data_foundation/4.11/*",{"uid":534,"title":1077,"bannerVariant":684,"bannerType":685,"bannerText":1078,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1080,"latestVersionLink":15,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"OpenShift Service Mesh 3.0 is a Technology Preview feature only",{"markdown":1079},"Technology Preview features are not supported with Red Hat production service level agreements (SLAs) and might not be functionally complete. Red Hat does not recommend using them in production. These features provide early access to upcoming product features, enabling customers to test functionality and provide feedback during the development process. This documentation is a work in progress and might not be complete or fully tested.\n",[1081,1083],{"plaintext":1082},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_service_mesh/3.0.0tp1",{"plaintext":1084},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_service_mesh/3.0.0tp1/*",{"uid":1086,"title":704,"bannerVariant":684,"bannerType":685,"bannerText":1087,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1089,"latestVersionLink":15,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"11",{"markdown":1088},"See documentation for the latest supported version [3](https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/openshift_container_platform/3.11) or the latest supported version [4](https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/openshift_container_platform/latest).\n",[1090,1092,1094,1096,1098,1100,1102,1104,1106,1108,1110,1112,1114,1116,1118,1120,1122,1124,1126,1128,1130,1132],{"plaintext":1091},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/3.0/*",{"plaintext":1093},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/3.1/*",{"plaintext":1095},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/3.2/*",{"plaintext":1097},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/3.3/*",{"plaintext":1099},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/3.4/*",{"plaintext":1101},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/3.5/*",{"plaintext":1103},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/3.6/*",{"plaintext":1105},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/3.7/*",{"plaintext":1107},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/3.8/*",{"plaintext":1109},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/3.9/*",{"plaintext":1111},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/3.10/*",{"plaintext":1113},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/4.1/*",{"plaintext":1115},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/4.2/*",{"plaintext":1117},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/4.3/*",{"plaintext":1119},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/4.4/*",{"plaintext":1121},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/4.5/*",{"plaintext":1123},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/4.6/*",{"plaintext":1125},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/4.7/*",{"plaintext":1127},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/4.8/*",{"plaintext":1129},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/4.9/*",{"plaintext":1131},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/4.10/*",{"plaintext":1133},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/4.11/*",{"uid":1135,"title":704,"bannerVariant":664,"bannerType":665,"bannerText":1136,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1138,"latestVersionLink":15,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"23",{"markdown":1137},"Power monitoring for Red Hat OpenShift is deprecated and will have no further releases or support.\n",[1139,1141,1143],{"plaintext":1140},"/documentation/power_monitoring_for_red_hat_openshift/0.3/*",{"plaintext":1142},"/documentation/power_monitoring_for_red_hat_openshift/0.4/*",{"plaintext":1144},"/documentation/power_monitoring_for_red_hat_openshift/0.5/*",{"uid":1146,"title":15,"bannerVariant":664,"bannerType":665,"bannerText":1147,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1149,"latestVersionLink":15,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"15",{"markdown":1148},"[Red Hat Trusted Application Pipeline](https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/red_hat_trusted_application_pipeline/latest) is now Red Hat Advanced Developer Suite - software supply chain starting with version 1.6.\n",[1150],{"plaintext":1151},"/documentation/red_hat_advanced_developer_suite_-_software_supply_chain/1.6/*",{"uid":1153,"title":15,"bannerVariant":664,"bannerType":665,"bannerText":1154,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1156,"latestVersionLink":15,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"22",{"markdown":1155},"Updates for Red Hat OpenShift AI Cloud Service are only provided up to the end of October 2025.\n",[1157],{"plaintext":1158},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_ai_cloud_service/*",{"uid":1160,"title":704,"bannerVariant":664,"bannerType":665,"bannerText":1161,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1162,"latestVersionLink":1165,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"25",{"markdown":15},[1163],{"plaintext":1164},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_ai_self-managed/3.2/*","/documentation/red_hat_openshift_ai_self-managed/3.4",{"uid":1167,"title":15,"bannerVariant":664,"bannerType":665,"bannerText":1168,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1170,"latestVersionLink":15,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"18",{"markdown":1169},"This is the documentation for Red Hat OpenShift Service on AWS classic architecture. The hosted control planes architecture documentation is available [here](https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/red_hat_openshift_service_on_aws/latest \"\").\n",[1171],{"plaintext":1172},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_service_on_aws_classic_architecture/*",{"uid":1174,"title":15,"bannerVariant":664,"bannerType":665,"bannerText":1175,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1177,"latestVersionLink":15,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"17",{"markdown":1176},"This is the documentation for the default architecture of Red Hat OpenShift Service on AWS. The classic architecture documentation is available [here](https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/red_hat_openshift_service_on_aws_classic_architecture/latest).\n",[1178],{"plaintext":1179},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_service_on_aws/*",{"uid":1181,"title":15,"bannerVariant":664,"bannerType":665,"bannerText":1182,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1184,"latestVersionLink":15,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"14",{"markdown":1183},"Red Hat Trusted Application Pipeline is now [Red Hat Advanced Developer Suite](https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/red_hat_advanced_developer_suite_-_software_supply_chain/latest) - software supply chain starting with version 1.6.\n",[1185],{"plaintext":1186},"/documentation/red_hat_trusted_application_pipeline/1.5/*",{"uid":1188,"title":1189,"bannerVariant":664,"bannerType":665,"bannerText":1190,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1192,"latestVersionLink":15,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"3762","FedRAMP End of Life",{"markdown":1191},"The FedRAMP-hosted deployment of Red Hat Lightspeed will be retired on October 30, 2026. For on-premises deployment with Satellite, see [Administering Red Hat Satellite](https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/red_hat_satellite/6.19/html/administering_red_hat_satellite/configuring-satellite-for-red-hat-lightspeed-analytics#migrating-from-hosted-to-in-satellite-red-hat-lightspeed \"\").\n",[1193],{"plaintext":1194},"/documentation/red_hat_lightspeed/1-latest",["Reactive",1196],{"$snuxt-i18n-meta":1197,"$saskRedHatChatInitialized":425,"$saskRedHatChatOpen":425,"$sisJumpLinkScroll":425,"$sisLoading":425,"$sisSinglePage":425,"$sisInFocusMode":425,"$smobileTocOpen":425,"$sisLargeTOC":425,"$scurrentChapter":240,"$scurrentSection":240,"$scurrentSubSection":1198},{},"",["Set"],["ShallowReactive",1201],{"rFVLKcOK8e":15,"uUstF4AIyn":15,"Pn02PlJOas":15},"/en/documentation/red_hat_enterprise_linux/10/html/securing_networks/setting-up-an-ipsec-vpn"]</script>
